      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いずれ目が見えなくなる人間に\r\n何を任せるというのだ……！\r\nもう放っておいてくれ……。",
        "official_en": "How do you expect me to work without my eyesight!? Just...leave me alone!",
        "real_en": "What could you possibly entrust to someone who's eventually going to lose his sight...!? Just leave me alone..."
