      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おや、その記章……\r\nグランシェルトの騎士さんか。",
        "official_en": "Say, that insignia... You’re knights of Grandshelt!",
        "real_en": "Oh, that insignia... You're a knight of Grandshelt, aren't you?"
