        "official_en_sha256": "349441a92e7c60818526846e6778514cc30c12da5a6ffba26c5411c9d713bf8c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このあたりは毒を持つ魔物が多いの。\r\n毒の効果は一見小さいけれど\r\n積み重なると、タダではすまないわ。",
        "official_en": "A lot of monsters around here are poisonous. Getting poisoned might not seem like a big deal at first, but let it go too long and it can prove lethal.",
        "real_en": "A lot of monsters around here are poisonous. Poison may not seem very harmful at first, but its effects build up and can be serious."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
