      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このクチバシのツヤ！　羽根の厚み！\r\nどうだい？　うちのチョコボは最高だろ？",
        "official_en": "Look at their perfect beaks and shiny feathers! I have the best chocobos around—guaranteed!",
        "real_en": "Look at the sheen of those beaks! The thickness of those feathers! My chocobos are the best, aren't they?"
      },
