      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そういう言葉を聞くために武器を作ってるんだって。",
        "official_en": "Weird, right? But she said the whole reason she makes weapons is to hear those words.",
        "real_en": "She said hearing things like that is why she makes weapons."
