      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そこのベッドの横に毒消し草があるから\r\nお守りとして持っていくといいわ。",
        "official_en": "Tell you what, I’ll let you have the antidote herbs in that chest next to the bed. Consider it a good luck charm for when you go out in the desert.",
        "real_en": "There's some antidote herb beside that bed. Take some with you as a good-luck charm."
