      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "アイリーンが作ってくれた武器を持っているだけで\r\n安心するの。\r\nそう話したら、彼女に逆に感謝されたわ。",
        "official_en": "Just having one of Aileen’s weapons makes me feel safe. So I told her that, and next thing you know she started showering <text style=\"italic\">me</> with praise!",
        "real_en": "Just holding a weapon Aileen made puts me at ease. When I told her that, she was the one who thanked me."
      },
