      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "砂漠にいる魔物はどれも危険だが、\r\n流砂に住む“砂漠のヌシ”は別格さ。\r\nつかまったら最後、全身の水分を吸い取られちまう。",
        "official_en": "But what you <text style=\"italic\">really</> need to be careful of is the Master of the Desert. You get caught by that thing, and it’ll quite literally suck all the moisture out of your bodies.",
